  "title": "`#include_next`",
  "summary": "`#include_next` and `__has_include_next` link to the next header of that name on the search path",
  "prose": "Here `first/wrap.h` shadows `second/wrap.h`, and its `#include_next` reaches\nthe second copy.",
  "status": "partial",
